    <article class="entry reveal" id="item-13">
      <header class="e-head">
        <div><span class="e-num">13</span><span class="e-of">/ 25</span></div>
        <div class="e-id"><p class="e-tag">Item 13 · Object: Wallet · A.A.B.B.A. · 5 lines</p><h2 class="e-name">Bill the Billfold</h2></div>
      </header>
      <div class="e-body">
        <div class="verse">
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">There once was a Bill the billfold,</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">A pocket of paper families of bills;</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">They’d fan out, all crisp,</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">When he’d tap his wrist:</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">“Good morning, my bills, and the whole village — no spills.”</span></p>
        </div>
        <aside class="e-side">
          <figure class="photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/bill-the-billfold/240/300" alt="Portrait No. 13 — Bill the Billfold" width="240" height="300" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Portrait No. 13</figcaption></figure>
          <p class="note"><span class="n-label">Note</span>A wallet; contains, at the time of writing, eleven (11) smaller Bills.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
      <span class="stamp e-stamp">Cleared</span>
    </article>
    <div class="perf" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <article class="entry reveal" id="item-14">
      <header class="e-head">
        <div><span class="e-num">14</span><span class="e-of">/ 25</span></div>
        <div class="e-id"><p class="e-tag">Item 14 · Object: Sign · A.A.B.B.A. · 5 lines</p><h2 class="e-name">Bill the Billboard</h2></div>
      </header>
      <div class="e-body">
        <div class="verse">
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">There once was a Bill the billboard,</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">Who’d holler out “SALE!” with the whole of his cord;</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">“LOST CAT — REWARD,”</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">Then “VOTE — ONE WORD,”</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">Then a quiet “BILL,” which the drivers adored.</span></p>
        </div>
        <aside class="e-side">
          <figure class="photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/bill-the-billboard/240/300" alt="Portrait No. 14 — Bill the Billboard" width="240" height="300" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Portrait No. 14</figcaption></figure>
          <p class="note"><span class="n-label">Note</span>After cycling through 4,096 advertisements, chose to display only his own name.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
      <span class="stamp e-stamp">Paid</span>
    </article>
    <div class="perf" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <article class="entry reveal" id="item-15">
      <header class="e-head">
        <div><span class="e-num">15</span><span class="e-of">/ 25</span></div>
        <div class="e-id"><p class="e-tag">Item 15 · Specimen: Tree · A.A.B.B.A. · 5 lines</p><h2 class="e-name">Bill the Willow</h2></div>
      </header>
      <div class="e-body">
        <div class="verse">
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">There once was a Bill the willow</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">Who’d dress, all year round, in a mellow yellow;</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">He’d dip in the stream</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">To comb out the cream,</span></p>
          <p class="lm"><span class="lm-i">And the ducks would go by, “Good morning, dear fellow.”</span></p>
        </div>
        <aside class="e-side">
          <figure class="photo"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/bill-the-willow/240/300" alt="Portrait No. 15 — Bill the Willow" width="240" height="300" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Portrait No. 15</figcaption></figure>
          <p class="note"><span class="n-label">Note</span>Combs in the stream each morning; the ducks have been told to keep their nods to themselves.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
      <span class="stamp e-stamp">Cleared</span>
