A note on the keywords: **bill** runs through the whole page (title, limericks, ticker, colophon), **economist** appears in limericks Nº 002–003, the ticker, and the footer, and **jurgen** (lowercase) is set in the ticker, the colophon, and the meta tag. Every one of the 25 notes is bouncy — tap any of them, shuffle the stack, or bounce 'em all to bond the series.
